    "body": "In Firefox, Chrome and Safari, if you go to \"about:blank\" and print location.pathname, it will be \"blank\". Not sure it this is expected or not but I thought I'd point it out, especially considering the new WPT expect the the pathname to be \"\" when the location's browsing context is gone, even though it's href is \"about:blank\".",
