    "body": "I asked Alex (who is our URL expert) and he seems to agree that \"blank\" should be the expected path name when the URL is \"about:blank\". If so, I think the WPT test that was added for this spec change needs to be updated to expect the pathname to be \"blank\" when the Location's browsing context is gone.",
